   - Issues search warrants for discovery of persons wrongfully confined (Section-100).
   - Directs search, in their presence, of any place for which they can issue a search warrant (Section-105).
   - Requires security to keep peace (Section-107).
   - Requires security for good behavior from vagrants and suspected persons (Section-109).
   - Requires security for good behavior from habitual offenders (Section-110).

